:: LaaB V0.03.05 

LaaB V0.03.05 "Questlog" Update Change Log

=Quest Log/Tracking Revamp=
-The Quest Log has been updated visually to improve it's look. More existing quests have also been added to be shown here.
-The overall Quest Tracking code has been improved to make managing and adding quests easier.
-A Quest Journal has been added to the Journal in the Player's Bedroom. This Journal will track the status of all Quests, Story Events, and One-Time Events in the game. With Cheats enabled, it will also providing Requirements and Trigger Conditions.
-Quests added to the Quest Log will now Ping the Notification System.

=Notification System/Sidebar=
-A Notification System has been added to the sidebar. It current pings when new Quests are added to the Quest Log. Other systems will be migrated there in future updates.
-The Notifications will remain in the queue until viewed, after which, it will be cleared upon entering a new passage after viewing them.
-Hovering your mouse over the Top Sidebar Display will now give a tooltip displaying Weather, Time of Day, and Temp. (PC Only)

=Core Cast Content=
-3 Complex Events for Giving Michael a Wedgie in the School Hallway. (Variations based on Social Status and many other Player Variables/Conditions.)
-3 Complex Events for Giving Xavier a Wedgie in the School Hallway. (Variations based on Social Status and many other Player Variables/Conditions.)
-3 Events for Giving Jackson a Wedgie in the School Hallway. (Variations based on Social Status.)
-3 Events for Giving Thomas a Wedgie in the School Hallway. (Variations based on Social Status.)
-3 Events for Giving Felix a Wedgie in the School Hallway. (Variations based on Social Status.)

